Package: tendshelf-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Tendshelf <noreply@tendshelf.invalid>
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libwebkitgtk-6.0-4, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-libav, ffmpeg
Recommends: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator
Homepage: https://github.com/Tend-Stack/tendshelf
Description: Tendshelf desktop app
 A window for your self-hosted audiobook shelf. It runs Tendshelf on this
 computer or opens a Tendshelf server you already have. Its libraries and
 ffmpeg come from apt, and it downloads nothing when it runs.
